# The advisory gate's own auditor. pip-audit-requirements.txt is compiled from
# this file with every file's hash, and CI installs it with
# `uv pip install --require-hashes --no-deps --only-binary :all:` into an
# environment of its own (.github/workflows/ci.yml, the advisory steps of job `baseline`).
# Dependabot (.github/dependabot.yml, directory /.github/scripts) regenerates
# the .txt from the command in its header; by hand, run that same command from
# this directory. Never edit the .txt itself.
